sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Person
  participant C as Central
  participant G as Grant
  participant V as Guest
  P->>C: share a record
  C-->>P: choose scope + expiry
  P->>C: scope · expiry
  C->>G: sign a view
  G-->>C: signed
  C-->>V: signed, scoped view
  V->>C: request the row
  C->>G: verify
  G-->>C: valid
  C-->>V: decrypt one view
  Note over C,V: the record never becomes public
  alt expired
    G-->>C: expired
    C-->>V: denied
  end
  Note over P,V: private stays local
